  <justification>
    <existing>`sprk_matter`'s creation path already assigns ownership correctly — this task generalizes an existing in-repo pattern rather than introducing one.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — extend the existing convention to the other record entities. No new component; the only new artifact is the backfill script.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Tasks 063, 064 and 066 ship authorization gates that refuse every ordinary user, Outlook's create-To-Do-from-email stays broken, and every future per-record gate on any BFF-created entity will fail the same way for the same reason.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

